description.narrative:
ul  li Capacity building of local communities: this includes transfer of new skills and enhancement of pre-existing skills in various aspects of the project activities especially related to vegetable production (including better post-harvest handling, storage and preservation through conversion into longer shelf-life products using simple methods such as pickling), and restoration of environmental resources;
 li Provision of appropriate inputs and assets (seeds and hand tools) and transfer of appropriate labour saving technologies (treadle pumps and irrigation kits);
 li Promotion of complementary income generating activities to cushion shocks affecting key livelihood strategies;
 li Promotion of agricultural production and restoration of environmental resources;
 li Support to small ruminants restocking and protection of livestock assets.
